AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#id> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0000091> "HP:0000091")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0000091> "The renal tubules are reabsorptive canals that are involved in the secreting, collecting, and conducting of the urine.")
