AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0000218> "The measuring device for this assessment is described in (Hall JG, Froster-Iskenius UG, Allanson JE, Gripp K, Slavotinek A. 2006. Handbook of Normal Physical Measurements. 2nd edition. Oxford Medical, publishers). A high palate is often associated with a narrow palate. However, a narrow palate can easily give a false appearance of a high palate. Height and width of the palate should be assessed and coded separately. We do not recommend the subjective determination because this term can be overused and applied inaccurately.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0000218> "High palate")
