AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0000502> "The conjunctiva is a thin, sparsely vascularized transparent membrane that covers and protects the sclera (the bulbar conjunctiva), and forms the inner lining of the eyelids (the tarsal conjunctiva).")
