AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0000527> "Measurement should be done on the longest lashes, which are usually at the center of the lid. Normal values are 7.99 - 1.05 mm in boys and 7.76 - 1.03 mm in girls. Note that Eyelash trichomegaly is defined as increase in length (12 mm or more), curling, pigmentation or thickness of eyelashes.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0000527> "Long eyelashes")
