AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0000674> "Anodontia can affect both primary and permanent teeth. Alternatively, there can be anodontia of just the permanent teeth. Anodontia must be distinguished from non-erupted teeth.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0000674> "Anodontia")
