AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#id> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0000759> "HP:0000759")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0000759> "The peripheral nervous system is divided into autonomic and somatic components, which both include afferent (sensory) and efferent (motor) nerves.")
