AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0001250> "A type of electrographic seizure has been proposed in neonates which does not have a clinical correlate, it is electrographic only. The term epilepsy is not used to describe recurrent febrile seizures. Epilepsy presumably reflects an abnormally reduced seizure threshold.")
