AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0001274> "Absence of the corpus callosum as a result of the failure of the corpus callosum to develop, which can be the result of a failure in any one of the multiple steps of callosal development including cellular proliferation and migration, axonal growth or glial patterning at the midline.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasAlternativeId> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0001274> "HP:0006800")
