# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0001405> (Periportal fibrosis)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0001405> "The presence of fibrosis affecting the interlobular stroma of liver.")
