AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0001405> "Liver fibrosis is not only the result of necrosis, collapse and scar formation but also the result of derangements in the synthesis and degradation of matrix by injured mesenchymal cells.")
