AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0001924> "Sideroblastic anemia may be either congenital or acquired. In sideroblastic anemia, the hematocrit tends to be around 20 to 30 percent, and the mean corpuscular volume is normal or low.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0001924> "Sideroblastic anemia")
