AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0001933> "This term refers to an abnormally increased susceptibility to bruising (purpura, petechiae, or ecchymoses).")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/date> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0001933> "2008-02-28T07:14:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime)
