AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463>) Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasSynonymType> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/hp#layperson>) <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasExactSynonym> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0002006> "Cleft of the face")
