AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <https://orcid.org/0009-0006-4530-3154>) Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:19652142") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:38812098") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0002185> "Pathological protein aggregates formed by hyperphosphorylation of a microtubule-associated protein known as tau, causing it to aggregate in an insoluble form.")
