AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0002251> "Aganglionic megacolon is characterized by congenital absence of intrinsic ganglion cells in the myenteric (Auerbach) and submucosal (Meissner) plexuses of the gastrointestinal tract.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0002251> "Aganglionic megacolon")
