AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#id> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0002600> "HP:0002600")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0002600> "Reflexes are sensorimotor arcs that require some type of sensory (afferent) signal, and some motor response. While the simplest of reflexes involve direct synapse between the sensory fiber and the motor neuron (monosynaptic), many reflexes have several neurons interposed (polysynaptic reflexes). Hyporeflexia can result from a defect anywhere in this chain.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0002600> "Hyporeflexia of lower limbs")
