AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0002885> "Medulloblastoma is a highly malignant primary brain tumor that originates in the cerebellum or posterior fossa and belonging to the family of cranial primitive neuroectodermal tumors.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0002885> "Medulloblastoma")
