# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0003133> (Abnormal spinocerebellar tract morphology)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0003133> "An abnormality of the spinocerebellar tracts, a set of axonal fibers originating in the spinal cord and terminating in the ipsilateral cerebellum. The spinocerebellar tract convey information to the cerebellum about limb and joint position (proprioception). They comprise the ventral spinocerebellar tract, the anterior spinocerebellar tract, and the posterior spinocerebellar tract.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasExactSynonym> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0003133> "Abnormality of the spinocerebellar tracts")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#id> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0003133> "HP:0003133")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0003133> "Abnormal spinocerebellar tract morphology")
EquivalentClasses(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0003133> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000051> ObjectIntersectionOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0000051> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002314> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0005413>) ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002573> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0000460>))))
