# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0007703> (Abnormal retinal pigmentation)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0007703> "Any deviation from the normal pigmentation of the retina.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasAlternativeId> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0007703> "HP:0007741")
